---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="sniffly - Disk Space Analyzer for Unix">
  <section>
    <img src="/image/sniffly1.png" alt="Sniffly disk space analyzer interface" style="width: 100%; max-width: 600px; margin: 2rem auto; display: block; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);" />

    <h2>about sniffly</h2>
    <p>
      sniffly is a disk space analyzer inspired by SpaceSniffer, designed
      specifically for Unix-based systems, and written entirely in modern Fortran. Visualize your disk usage and quickly
      identify what's taking up space on your machine.
    </p>

    <h2>features</h2>
    <ul style="margin-left: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;">
      <li>visual treemap representation of disk usage</li>
      <li>fast scanning engine</li>
      <li>interactive navigation</li>
      <li>toggle dotfiles/hiddens</li>
      <li>quick open in finder</li>
      <li>quick delete of offending files</li>
      <li>native macOS application</li>
    </ul>

    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 3rem;">
      <a href="/downloads" class="btn">Download Now</a>
    </div>

    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 2rem; color: #666;">
      <p>...or</p>
      <p style="font-weight: 600; margin-top: 0.5rem;">install with homebrew</p>
    </div>

    <div class="terminal-wrapper">
      <div class="terminal">
        <div class="terminal-header">
          <div class="terminal-controls">
            <button class="control-btn close" id="terminal-close" aria-label="Collapse terminal"></button>
            <button class="control-btn minimize" aria-label="Minimize"></button>
            <button class="control-btn maximize" aria-label="Maximize"></button>
          </div>
          <div class="terminal-title">Terminal</div>
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-body" id="terminal-body">
          <div class="terminal-line comment"># Tap the repository</div>
          <div class="terminal-line command"><span class="prompt">$</span> brew tap FortranGoingOnForty/sniffly</div>
          <div class="terminal-line comment"># Install sniffly</div>
          <div class="terminal-line command"><span class="prompt">$</span> brew install --cask sniffly</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <style>
      .terminal-wrapper {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 2rem auto;
      }

      .terminal {
        background: #1e1e1e;
        border-radius: 8px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        font-family: 'Menlo', 'Monaco', 'Courier New', monospace;
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .terminal-header {
        background: #2d2d2d;
        padding: 10px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        position: relative;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #3d3d3d;
      }

      .terminal-controls {
        display: flex;
        gap: 8px;
      }

      .control-btn {
        width: 12px;
        height: 12px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        border: none;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: filter 0.2s;
      }

      .control-btn:hover {
        filter: brightness(1.2);
      }

      .control-btn.close {
        background: #ff5f56;
      }

      .control-btn.minimize {
        background: #ffbd2e;
      }

      .control-btn.maximize {
        background: #27c93f;
      }

      .terminal-title {
        position: absolute;
        left: 50%;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
        color: #999;
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 500;
      }

      .terminal-body {
        padding: 16px;
        color: #d4d4d4;
        line-height: 1.8;
        max-height: 300px;
        overflow: hidden;
        transition: max-height 0.3s ease, padding 0.3s ease;
      }

      .terminal-body.collapsed {
        max-height: 0;
        padding: 0 16px;
      }

      .terminal-line {
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      .terminal-line.comment {
        color: #6a9955;
      }

      .terminal-line.command {
        color: #d4d4d4;
      }

      .prompt {
        color: #4ec9b0;
        margin-right: 8px;
      }
    </style>

    <script>
      const closeBtn = document.getElementById('terminal-close');
      const terminalBody = document.getElementById('terminal-body');

      closeBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        terminalBody?.classList.toggle('collapsed');
      });
    </script>

    <p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 3rem; color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem;">
      freeware (donations are welcome)
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
